  "notes": [
    "बजे marks the hour: नौ बजे हैं is \"it's nine o'clock\". One o'clock is singular: एक बजा है.",
    "साढ़े adds a half: साढ़े चार is 4:30. But 1:30 is डेढ़ and 2:30 is ढाई. सवा adds a quarter (सवा पाँच, 5:15) and पौने takes one away (पौने छह, 5:45).",
    "The days: सोमवार, मंगलवार, बुधवार, गुरुवार, शुक्रवार, शनिवार, रविवार. In cities, Monday, Sunday and so on are common too.",
    "मुझे देर हो गई (\"to me lateness happened\") is the same for a man and a woman."
  ]
